<view wx:if="{{accountReady}}" class="page welcome"><view class="steps"><view class="filled"/><view class="{{step==='mode'?'filled':''}}"/></view><block wx:if="{{step==='sort'}}"><xiaoda pose="greet" text="{{intro}}"/><view class="sorting-list"><template-editor config="{{config}}" bindchange="change"/></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><view class="bottom"><button class="primary" bindtap="next">排好啦</button></view></block><block wx:else><xiaoda pose="think" text="你喜欢哪种记录方式呀？"/><view class="modes"><view class="mode unavailable"><view class="subtitle">精简模式</view><view class="tag">待完善</view><view class="example"><view>门窗</view><text>看说明，统一记录。</text></view><text class="muted">完整内容准备中，暂不可选</text></view><view class="mode selected"><view class="subtitle">详细模式</view><view class="tag">已选择</view><view class="example"><view>门窗</view><text>{{example}}</text></view><text>逐项检查，分别记录。</text><view class="choice">☑ 详细模式</view></view></view><view class="bottom"><button class="back" bindtap="back">返回调整</button><button class="primary grow" bindtap="finish" loading="{{busy}}">选好啦</button></view></block></view>
